//    with the verdict — not the H id.)
//
//   THE QUESTION (frozen-first, falsifiable — a NULL/collapse is a valid result, c9):
//     H_1295 measured collective-Φ super-additivity (Φ(joint) > Σ Φ(member)) over an
//     ABSTRACT ECA substrate (rule-110/90 cells). The r2 agent flagged that engine-
//     transfer to a LIVE multi-anima loop (real coupled A⇄G substrates) is UNVERIFIED.
//     Does the super-additivity HOLD when the members are REAL coupled anima A⇄G
//     substrates (live core/pure_field.hexa + core/brain.hexa tension-link), not
//     abstract rule-90/ECA cells?
//
//   REAL SUBSTRATE (a_engine_native_learning — NOT an abstract rule lookup):
//     Each member is a REAL anima PureField (3 coupled oscillators → 6-D field tensor,
//     core/pure_field.hexa). Two members are coupled via the REAL TENSION-LINK channel
//     (H_6009 🟢): member A's field-derived 5-ch tension state, carried as a kosmos
//     anchor, modulates member B's brain_decide_anchored fold (and vice versa), gated by
//     coupling strength W. The joint n=6 TPM transition for EACH of the 64 input states
//     is read from REAL pure_field_step dynamics + the REAL anchor_tension_fold coupling
//     — engine state, NOT iit4_bit(rule, idx).
//
//   Φ = faithful IIT-4 ONLY (a_phi_iit4_tool) via big_phi_bounded — numpy NEVER
//   computes Φ. n=3 per member (cap=3 exact), joint n=6 (cap=2 lower-bound), sys=0.
//   Faithful-Φ n≤8 ceiling respected (NO n=9+, ~84min/call).
//
//   FROZEN BARS (pre-registered BEFORE scoring; no tune-to-green, a_break_the_wall):
//     B1 PRESENCE   — Δ_real = Φ(real-coupled) − Σ Φ(member) ≥ +1.0  [super-additive on
//                     the REAL A⇄G substrate, every seed].
//     B2 TRANSFER   — the KEY question: does the ECA Δ REPRODUCE on real A⇄G coupling?
//                     Δ_real > 0 (same SIGN as the ECA Δ=+10.4756) ⇒ TRANSFERS;
//                     Δ_real ≤ 0 ⇒ honest NULL (ECA artifact, does NOT transfer).
//     B3 DECOUPLE   — set tension-link W=0 → Δ(W=0) ≤ 0 (the lift IS the real coupling,
//                     not an artifact of joining two state spaces).
//     B4 SHUFFLE    — permute the real-state→cell readout (same engine magnitude,
//                     scrambled state↔cell map) → Δ_shuffle collapses below Δ_real
//                     (Δ_real − Δ_shuffle ≥ +1.0 OR Δ_shuffle ≤ 0): the lift is the real
//                     structured coupling, not generic variance.
//
//   3 seeds [1300,1301,1302] drive the shuffle control (the real-coupled core value is
